"edit_calls": 1, "ended_on_rejection": false, "error": null, "exec_mode": "local", "failure_class": "solved", "failure_reason": null, "faults_served": 0, "final_answer_complete": true, "final_answer_present": true, "final_answer_source": "json", "final_workspace": "/workspace/openbench-ab/results/step5-opus-aa-1017-omp36-aa/omp-36/cells/aa-2/trig-omp-reported/28/workspace", "first_after_build": false, "first_side": "aa-2", "fresh_subagents": 0, "harness": "omp", "harness_version": "omp/17.3.8 (/workspace/openbench-ab/results/omp-cache/bin/omp/5347ff91e8f44f2c69a79d7b152b7301687cd5c8/omp)", "harness_version_source": "host", "host": "grok-bot-vm-412615941", "image_digest": null, "last_activity_age_s": null, "list_has_generated": null, "main_agent_searched": false, "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "model_context_window": 1000000, "model_max_tokens": 128000, "output_tail": "I fixed `parse_date` in `dates/parse.py`. It used `strptime(s, \"%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%S\")`, a fixed format with nothing to match a trailing `Z`, so that letter was left over and raised the error. It now uses `datetime.fromisoformat(s)`. All 3 tests in `tests/test_parse.py` pass: `test_dates`, `test_naive` and `test_day_key`.\n\nTwo behaviour changes:\n- **Time zones are kept now.** A string ending in `Z` returns a datetime marked as UTC, and one with an offset like `+02:00` keeps that offset. Strings with no zone still return a datetime with no zone, as before. Comparing a zoned datetime with an unzoned one raises `TypeError`, so any caller that mixes the two would break.\n- **It accepts more ISO-8601 forms than before**, such as fractional seconds or date-only strings.\n\n`fromisoformat` only accepts `Z` on Python 3.11 or newer. The local Python is 3.13.5, and the repo has no `pyproject.toml` or `setup.py` stating a minimum version. On Python 3.10 or older, `Z` input would fail again.", "paced_wait_s": 0.0, "params_stripped": [], "params_stripped_requests": 0, "permission_rejections": 0, "read_calls": 2, "replies_ok": 6, "replies_throttled": 0, "requests_cache_read": 50688, "requests_cache_write": 105523, "requests_cost_usd": 0.5616286, "requests_count": 6, "requests_input_uncached": 14, "requests_output": 1191, "reread": false, "rule_order": "none", "rule_prefix": "neither", "run_id": "omp:trig-omp-reported:claude-opus-5-5:trial28", "run_seed": 1016, "sampling_observed": null, "schedule_index": 54, "score": 1.0, "started_at": "2026-10-17T22:51:16.809268+00:00", "subagent_resumed": false, "subagent_write_calls": 0, "success": true, "t_agent_s": 26.252, "t_checker_s": 0.325, "t_env_setup_s": 0.001, "task": "trig-omp-reported", "task_calls": 0, "thinking_mode": "default", "thinking_sent": ["adaptive", "adaptive", "adaptive", "adaptive", "adaptive", "adaptive"], "timeout_s": 840, "tmpdir_leaked_dirs": 0, "token_basis": "proxy_measured", "token_basis_main": "estimated", "token_basis_proxy": "proxy_measured", "tokens": 1205, "tokens_cache_read": 50688, "tokens_cache_write": 105523, "tokens_fresh": 1205, "tokens_input_uncached": 14, "tokens_main_cache_read": 50688, "tokens_main_cache_write": 105523, "tokens_main_calls": 6, "tokens_main_input_uncached": 14, "tokens_main_output": 1191, "tokens_output": 1191, "tokens_proxy_cache_read": 50688, "tokens_proxy_cache_write": 105523, "tokens_proxy_calls": 6, "tokens_proxy_input_uncached": 14, "tokens_proxy_output": 1191, "tokens_proxy_reasoning": null, "tokens_reasoning": 0, "trial": 28, "ts_iso": "2026-10-17T18:51:16", "turn_mode": null, "turns": 6, "upstream_model": "claude-opus-5-5", "usage_raw": [{"cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 25193, "cost": {"cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "input": 0, "output": 0, "total": 0}, "cttl": {"ephemeral5m": 25193}, "input": 4, "output": 87, "totalTokens": 25284}, {"cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 25495, "cost": {"cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "input": 0, "output": 0, "total": 0}, "cttl": {"ephemeral5m": 25495}, "input": 2, "output": 152, "totalTokens": 25649}, {"cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 26068, "cos